From 444818c4d462f503cc8669f07c82c90a5687c504 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 19:07:51 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] www: the AiMesh add-node window in the Reaper palette, with
 its own wording in 25 packs

The one wizard flow Reaper keeps (AiMesh add-node / node mode) ran in the
stock palette. reaper_qis.css is appended after the stock qis.css by the
www Makefile so it wins by order (the stock sheet and the theme injector,
which refuses QIS_* pages on purpose, are untouched). The search page
carries a centred title, progressive wording and a prerequisites box with
its own keys, RAMS_1..9, in all 25 packs, and long words are clipped.
Owner review on the _r2/_r3 test images. Lean: tests/test_qis_theme_append.py,
tests/test_amas_pages_i18n.py (every key the AiMesh pages use exists in
every pack).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
